      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "[TUTORIAL COMO USAR FLX 2 KLEIN](https://youtu.be/sMu4GP2y4UU)\n\n\n## Descarga de Modelos\n\n**text_encoders**\n- [qwen_3_4b_fp4_flux2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b_fp4_flux2.safetensors?download=true)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors 3.8Gb](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors)\n\n- [flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors 7.7Gb](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- [Modelos GGUF](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/FLUX.2-klein-4B-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_4b_fp4_flux2.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors\n│   │      └── flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors\n│   │      └── Modelos GGUF\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Note:\nNo se te olvide Actualizar ComfyUI e Instalar los Nodos que te Falten para que no tengas Errores"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
